{
 "about": "Shared surface library for Bike Models V2. One tag per finish; every model and every pool part uses these and nothing else, so bikes from different brands sit together. A tag written tag__slot takes its colour from that colour slot of the bike (body, frame, rim, fork, accent). Colours are linear RGB. bump is a fine surface grain (size in mm, depth 0-1) used in renders and as a hint for the game material. ue names the game's existing bike material (/Game/Bike/Materials/MI_<ue>) the surface is shown on until V2 has its own; unless ue_tint is false the game sets that material's colour, metallic and roughness from this file.",
